For orders():
Original:
```php
    public function orders()
    {
        return Order::all()->map(fn ($o) => [
            'id' => $o->id,
            'user' => $o->user->name,
            'items_count' => $o->items->count(),
        ]);
    }
```
Fixed:
```php
    public function orders()
    {
        return Order::with(['user', 'items'])->get()->map(fn ($o) => [
            'id' => $o->id,
            'user' => $o->user->name,
            'items_count' => $o->items->count(),
        ]);
    }
```

